### GET ALL
GET http://localhost:3000/api/localidades

### SAVE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/localidades
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pais": "Argentina",
    "provincia": "Santa Fe",
    "nombre": "Rosario",
    "codigoPostal": 3000
}

###ID
@id = 3

### GET ONE
GET http://localhost:3000/api/localidades/{{id}}

### UPDATE
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/localidades/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pais": "Argentina",
  "provincia": "La Pampa",
  "nombre": "Santa Rosa",
  "codigoPostal": 2000
}

### DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/localidades/{{id}}